==English==

===Etymology===
From {{derived|en|grc|ἥλιος||sun}}. Appears in English first in the 16th century.

===Pronunciation===
*{{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/hɪˈlaɪəˌkəl/}}

===Adjective===
{{head|en|adjective}}

# {{lb|en|rare}} Of or relating to the [[Sun]], especially [[rising]] and [[setting]] with the sun.
# Of or relating to the rising of a star when it first becomes visible just before [[sunrise]] in the eastern sky, having previously been made invisible by [[sunlight]], or the analogous situation of its setting just after [[sunset]].

